      "rationale": "A rehash version must have only b3: hashes and follow a git: version. With allowProvisionalHashes off, only each live unit's latest version must be b3:, so recorded history keeps its git: hashes. A note anchored to a unit stays confirmed through rehash versions, since they re-record the same code.",
